sequenceDiagram
 participant U as User
 participant C as Client
 participant A as API
 participant D as Database
 U->>C: optional register or login
 C->>A: auth request
 A->>D: verify and create session
 D-->>A: session
 A-->>C: response and cookie
 C->>A: auth/me
 U->>C: logout
 C->>A: auth/logout
 A->>D: revoke session
